# Starbucks Sales Forecasting using Time Series Models

## Project Overview

This project focuses on forecasting Starbucks sales using Time Series Analysis techniques such as ARIMA, SARIMA, Prophet, and LSTM models. The analysis helps identify seasonal trends, growth patterns, and future sales predictions.

